SHIPS = [
    {'code': 'AQ', 'name': 'Carnival Adventure', 'slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/AQ/carnival-adventure-ship-header-png.png', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Asia', 'Australia', 'South Pacific'], 'sail_from': ['Sydney (White Bay), Australia', 'Singapore', 'Sydney, Australia', 'Auckland, New Zealand', 'Melbourne, Australia', 'Adelaide, Australia'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}},
    {'code': 'BR', 'name': 'Carnival Breeze', 'slug': 'carnival-breeze', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/BR/carnival-breeze-1.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Galveston, TX'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>On Carnival Breeze, fun-fan faves like SportSquare<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, and mouth-watering dining spots like Cucina del Capitano<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, are just the beginning of how this ship keeps the fun blazing.</p>\n    \n    <p>Speaking of blazing, enjoy the island atmosphere of the very cool RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, or south-of-the-border taco goodness at BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. There are many fish in the sea… and somewhere among the expertly-pruned bonsai trees, Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> proves it. But don’t forget the ambiance of Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> — roadside-burger-shack style — featuring hot-off-the-grill burgers designed by celebrity chef Guy Fieri!</p>\n    \n    <p>Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse prides itself on premium cuts, cooked exactly the way you like \'em... plus gourmet appetizers and wine pairings. And to go just a little less refined, stop by Pizza Pirate for a hot slice, the Carnival Deli for a true classic, or Guy\'s Pig & Anchor Bar-B-Que Smokehouse<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> to get a little messy with some signature — you guessed it — Guy Fieri BBQ. On this ship, you just can\'t get enough Guy!</p>\n    \n    <p>Carnival Breeze has the whole family covered — with water, that is — with a 320-foot-long Twister Waterslide<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> at Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. Just for the kids there\'s supervised youth programs Camp Ocean<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, Circle \'C\'<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> and Club O2<sup style="font-size:70%;">&reg;</sup>. And for the bigger people, there\'s time to be spent doing blissfully nothing at Serenity Adults-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>... after pampering yourself at Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, of course.</p>\n    \n    <p>Keep the fun going once the sun\'s done for the day by dancing in your seat at Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>... or if you prefer to do your dancing on a dance floor, check out Liquid Nightclub<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. Speaking of liquid, Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> serves up cocktail concoctions made with ingredients a little less ordinary and flavors a lot more interesting. Then there\'s always something funny going on at the Punchliner Comedy Club<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>.</p>\n    \n    <p>If you notice a bit of the outdoors inside, don\'t adjust your view. Carnival Breeze\'s staterooms — and many of the public spaces around the ship — feature a scintillating tropical décor and contemporary furnishings that\'ll transport you straight to warm Caribbean bliss.</p>\n    \n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/BR/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-breeze-1.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/BR/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-breeze-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/BR/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-breeze-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/BR/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-breeze-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'CB', 'name': 'Carnival Celebration', 'slug': 'carnival-celebration', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/CB/carnival-celebration/heros/carnival-celebration-ship-aerial-hero-desktop.jpg', 'intro': ['EXPERIENCE LIKE THAT… BUILDS SHIPS LIKE THIS!', 'Carnival Celebration sails from Miami', "filled with so much fun. Let's get packing!"], 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Miami, FL'], 'durations': ['6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': 'You know, it’s hard work making effortlessly-fun vacations. That’s why we’re looking forward to kicking back with you on Carnival Celebration as we toast to the last 50 years. So please bring that unique Carnival spirit... and know that this ship’s bringing the fun. Just like sister ship Mardi Gras<sup style="font-size:70%">&reg;</sup>, Carnival Celebration has <strong>six Zones</strong> — themed areas that bring together incredible experiences and flavor. New flavors you haven’t experienced yet — nobody has! — are heating up at <strong>Latitudes&trade;</strong>, <strong>The Golden Jubilee&trade;</strong> and <strong>Emeril’s Bistro 1397&trade;</strong>. (Mmm, new Emeril.) Carnival Celebration also marks the return of innovations like <strong>BOLT<sup style="font-size:70%">&reg;</sup></strong> — our onboard rollercoaster, <strong>Bonsai Teppanyaki&trade;</strong>, <strong>RedFrog<sup style="font-size:70%">&reg;</sup> Tiki Bar</strong>, <strong>Family Feud&trade; Live</strong>, <strong>Havana Bar&trade;</strong>, <strong>Seuss at Sea&trade;</strong>, and <strong>Playlist Productions&trade;</strong>. Perhaps best of all, all the fun you’ll have on Carnival Celebration is powered by clean LNG fuel!', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/CB/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-celebration-8.png', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CB/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-celebration-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CB/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-celebration-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CB/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-celebration-4.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CB/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-celebration-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CB/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-celebration-6.jpg']},
    {'code': 'CQ', 'name': 'Carnival Conquest', 'slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/CQ/carnival-conquest-3.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Miami, FL'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>Cruising aboard Carnival Conquest elevates fun at sea to an art form — the ship demonstrates a true mastery of the craft with an onboard collage of fun spots for you to enjoy, like Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> and SkyBox<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> Sports Bar.</p>\n    \n    <p>There\'s fun everywhere you look, from the dance club (great for people-watching) to the show lounges (great for show-watching). Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> serves up not only one-of-a-kind drinks, but a complete experience for your senses. There\'s even The Punchliner Comedy Club<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, which gives stand-up comedians a microphone and a place to share their craft for your enjoyment. And let\'s not forget Seuss at Sea<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> , which turns classic Dr. Seuss stories and characters into big fun for all.</p>\n    \n    <p>You don\'t need to be able to tell a Monet from a Renoir to dine in our two artful dining rooms, you just need to be hungry. You don\'t even need to be a critic to enjoy Dive-In Movies, where cinematic favorites are up on the big screen, poolside.</p>\n    \n    <p>With delicious food, bars and entertainment, Carnival Conquest features a scene for everybody.</p>\n    \n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/CQ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-conquest-7.png', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CQ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-conquest-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CQ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-conquest-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/CQ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-conquest-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'DR', 'name': 'Carnival Dream', 'slug': 'carnival-dream', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/DR/StateroomCodes/DRISSP.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Galveston, TX', 'New Orleans, LA'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n<p>It\'s one thing to be fun, but it\'s another thing to be first. Carnival Dream was at the forefront of a recent wave of amazingly innovative and fun Carnival ships. As the genesis of the Dream class, Carnival Dream set the direction for the ships that followed in her footsteps &mdash; first Carnival Magic and then Carnival Breeze.</p>\n\n<p>But back to Carnival Dream: the ship itself is a unique experience with the way-fun RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> and the very cool BlueIguana Tequila Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>. Get your appetite ready, because you\'re gonna need it. Carnival Dream features two dual-level dining rooms, a gourmet steakhouse and dedicated sushi spot Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>. It\'s also got a full menu of our latest and greatest casual spots for a bite: BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, Pizzeria del Capitano, Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> and Guy\'s Pig &amp; Anchor Smokehouse<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>. (That\'s Guy as in Guy Fieri, by the way &mdash; so you know the food\'s delish.)</p>\n\n<p>Carnival Dream also features the borderline-magical Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> and Ocean Plaza, which combines tasty treats with perhaps even tastier entertainment. Entertainment options are all up and down the ship, and so is soaking-wet fun, from the heart-racing waterslide action at Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> to the soul-soothing Hydrotherapy pool at the Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>.</p>\n\n<p>Despite its name, Carnival Dream is definitely a reality. Can\'t believe it? Pinch yourself... and book your dream cruise today.</p>\n\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/DR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-dream-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/DR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-dream-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/DR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-dream-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/DR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-dream-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'EL', 'name': 'Carnival Elation', 'slug': 'carnival-elation', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/EL/StateRoomCodes/ELSUSUO.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas'], 'sail_from': ['Jacksonville, FL'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n<p>Carnival Elation was built to celebrate the muses who inspire the arts. Carnival guests like you can expect this ship to inspire you... to have tons of vacation fun.</p>\n\n<p>Not that Carnival Elation is going to have a hard time convincing you! As you head toward your destination, you\'ll find plenty of spots to visit for a tasty bite &mdash; options like the taco-\'n-burrito goodness of BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, the burgers-\'n-fries combo of Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, plus all the rotating goodness of Lido Restaurant. (Our suggestion: bring an appetite and try them all!) Carnival Elation also features places to enjoy a drink, from the mystical Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> to the friendly poolside rivals RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> and BlueIguana Tequila Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>... and don’t forget everybody’s friend, the always-swinging Duke’s Piano Bar.</p>\n\n<p>If being a kid is more your thing, we have plenty of ideas for how to spend your time. Activities that are age-appropriate, supervised &mdash; and of course, fun! &mdash; are available for the actual kids at one of three youth spaces. Then there\'s the video arcade... oh, and did we mention the slidey, splashy, squirty Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>? We didn\'t, but we should have, because both of these are fun for all &mdash; all ages, that is!</p>\n\n<p>Come cruise and we bet you’ll see, and feel, that this ship is ready to inspire everyone in new ways.</p>\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/EL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-elation-6.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/EL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-elation-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/EL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-elation-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/EL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-elation-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'EQ', 'name': 'Carnival Encounter', 'slug': 'carnival-encounter', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/EQ/open-for-sale/carnival-encounter-hero-desktop.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Australia', 'South Pacific'], 'sail_from': ['Brisbane, Australia'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}},
    {'code': 'FT', 'name': 'Carnival Festivale', 'slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/heros/carnival-festivale-hero-desktop.jpg', 'intro': ['Shout-out to our next ship, setting sail in 2027\nfrom Port Canaveral with immersive experiences in its pocket,\nfamily fun in its heart, and music in its soul.'], 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Port Canaveral (Orlando), Fl'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': 'Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> has a name that echoes one of our earliest ships, but this is a truly new release, and the features are made to help us band together to enjoy vacation, with extra experiences that focus on family harmony. What\'s on the playlist? Across the ship\'s six Zones — including two new ones that are music-inspired and incredibly immersive — you\'ll find things like the deck-spanning Studio 724 multimedia experience, featuring unique light and sound effects. Mix brings a producer\'s touch to any cocktail-sipping session, while The Festival delivers the outdoor vibe and variety with its lineup of Pizza Palooza and Rhythm & Rolls Deli. Families will love the open-air Sunsation Point, with its Carnival WaterWorks Ultra and raft rides SunSoaker and Turning Tides, plus drier ways to play. But among all that\'s new, it\'s our pleasure to welcome back to the stage fan-favorite sip-alongs Alchemy Bar and Piano Bar 88, show spot Limelight Lounge, and all-time flavor jams Big Chicken and Swirls. Is that the end? Of course not — we\'ll announce even more later!', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-carnival-festivale-tile.jpg']},
    {'code': 'FN', 'name': 'Carnival Firenze', 'slug': 'carnival-firenze', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/FN/open-for-sale/carnival-firenze-piazza-duomo-desktop-hero.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Bermuda', 'Canada/New England', 'Caribbean', 'Mexico', 'South America'], 'sail_from': ['Long Beach (Los Angeles), Ca', 'Buenos Aires, Argentina', 'Miami, FL', 'Manhattan, New York City, NY', 'Port Canaveral (Orlando), Fl'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<style>\n    .emojiResize {\n        width: 16px;\n        height: 16px;\n    }\n    \n    </style>\n<blockquote>\n    <p>\n        If you\'re wondering what to expect from <strong>Fun Italian Style<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>? Grab your movie star sunglasses and throw on a scarf — just for style — as you make your entrance at <strong>Piazza Duomo</strong>, named for Florence\'s iconic domed cathedral. To get a taste for onboard flavor and flair, check out spots like the elegant three-course <strong>Michelangelo</strong> and <strong>Medici Restaurants</strong>, traditional Italian foods, cocktails and more at <strong>Il Viaggio</strong>, plus Italian street food spot <strong>La Strada Grill<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>. You\'re even going to find an Italian market, <strong>Il Mercato</strong>, featuring faves like sauced-up meatballs, sandwiches with inspiration from Italy and beyond, plus sausages and salads. And since we\'re always authentic… most of the time, you can enjoy the fusion-y goodness of Mexican-Italian  <strong>Tomodoro<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> plus <strong>Guy\'s Burger Joint</strong>, which now features classics and burgers with Italian twists. </p>\n        \n        <p>For refreshment served up in a glass, look to cocktail bar <strong>Amari<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, frozen drinks with a bit of attitude at <strong>Rococó<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, <strong>Frizzante<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> with its three specialties (bubbly drinks, snacks and coffee!), plus classic Italian cocktails and martinis with surprising and fashionable twists (and live music too!) at <strong>Moda Bar and Lounge<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>. Even more spots for entertainment include the classic-theater vibe of <strong>Teatro Rosso</strong> featuring Playlist Productions shows, and <strong>Tuscan Lounge</strong> paying tribute to Florence\'s iconic home region. Let\'s not forget <strong>Terrazza staterooms</strong> — we could never! — which give you a stylish, comfy place to unwind from all the fun… near a private deck featuring exclusive amenities like all-day lounging at <strong>Terrazza Moda</strong> home to great views, drinks, entertainment, whirlpools and more.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        While we\'re excited about the Italian side of this ship, it\'s not the whole story. Carnival has some true fan-favorites we knew folks would be asking for. (&#9829;) That\'s why Carnival Firenze also includes familiar flavors like <strong>Bonsai Teppanyaki<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and <strong>Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>. Places to celebrate absolutely anything (or just nothing!) include <strong>Piano Bar 88</strong> and <strong>Serenity Bar</strong>, while you can seriously kick back at <strong>Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and <strong>Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>. Kids are going to love <strong>Camp Ocean<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, <strong>Circle “C”<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup></strong> and <strong>Club O2<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup></strong> — each one is perfectly designed for a different age group. And if active/splashy fun is your thing, that\'s honestly a great thing and we can tell you\'re going to be spending time at <strong>WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and <strong>SportSquare<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, home to a ropes course, jogging track, mini golf course and outdoor fitness center.\n    </p>\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/FN/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-firenze-3.jpg']},
    {'code': 'FD', 'name': 'Carnival Freedom', 'slug': 'carnival-freedom', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/FD/carnival-freedom-1.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Bermuda', 'Canada/New England', 'Caribbean', 'Europe'], 'sail_from': ['Barcelona, Spain', 'Port Canaveral (Orlando), Fl', 'Norfolk, VA'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>Carnival Freedom has a message for you, and its "feel free to have fun!" Explore the ship and you\'ll find food options galore, starting with two dining rooms, but definitely extending outdoors — there\'s mouth-watering Guy Fieri burgers at Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, plus the greatest tacos and burritos this side of the pier at BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. For delicious, but quick and easy, selections from the sea, get your chopsticks around all the good stuff at Bonsai Sushi Express<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>.</p>\n    \n    <p>For every great food spot, there\'s a great place to enjoy drinks, too, from the toe-tapping Scott\'s Piano Bar to the always-hoppin\' 70\'s Nightclub. For the thirsty, libation hotspots include Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> and the place we all gather to raise very important toasts: Heroes Tribute<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Bar & Lounge. Everybody\'s favorite outdoor seaside bar is here... whether yours is the RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> or BlueIguana Tequila Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. (Or hey, make it both!) The rum bar\'s older brother, RedFrog Pub<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, features drinks, live music and traditional pub games. Topping off adult-time is Serenity — adult-only, of course — the retreat where total relaxation is not only encouraged, but pretty much required.</p>\n    \n    <p>If you\'re a kid, Carnival Freedom means you\'re in for a treat. Not only will you find new friends at one of three youth spaces — like Camp Ocean<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> — but you can splash around with them in one of our many pools, speed down a waterslide at Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, or once you dry off, challenge them to a round of mini-golf. Oh, and adults — don\'t get jealous; your inner kid gets to do all this stuff too! </p>\n    \n    <p>Up on stage is Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, featuring songs you know... and dance moves you\'ll soon be using. </p>\n    \n    <p>And for the cherry on top... it\'s actually called Cherry On Top<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. It\'s the spot for something special, whether that something\'s a little something sweet — or simply a little something to sweeten a special occasion.</p>\n    \n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/FD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-freedom-6.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/FD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-freedom-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/FD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-freedom-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/FD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-freedom-4.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/FD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-freedom-5.jpg']},
    {'code': 'GL', 'name': 'Carnival Glory', 'slug': 'carnival-glory', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/GL/carnival-glory-1.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas'], 'sail_from': ['Port Canaveral (Orlando), Fl'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n<p>If you\'re looking for a vacation at sea that\'s as colorful as the d&eacute;cor of the cruise ship taking you there, an entire palette of fun activities and hot spots awaits aboard Carnival Glory. For starters, there\'s a rainbow of salsa options for dressing up your tacos and burritos at BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, while Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> serves up burgers designed by the colorful personality himself: celebrity chef Guy Fieri.</p>\n\n<p>Speaking of colorful personalities, you\'ll enjoy a variety of stand-up comedians at The Punchliner Comedy Club<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. Picture yourself grabbing a drink at the open-air RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> or BlueIguana Tequila Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>... whichever color or spirit\'s more your style. Enjoy a show on the stage at Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, complete with singing and dancing, plus video screens that bring these productions an extra splash of color. Speaking of splash, at Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> the fun flows down the winding curves of the classic Twister and all-new AquaTunnel waterslide &mdash; plus twin racing slides and a giant tipping bucket &mdash; for countless gallons of fun. And if a picture paints a thousand words, imagine the millions flying off the big screen during a film under the stars at Dive-In Movies. Yes, it\'s Hollywood meets islands for a date night done right.</p>\n\n<p>We\'re not just viewing this ship with rose-colored lenses, either &mdash; it\'s clear that the fun, eye-catching experiences all around you are the real deal... even the fantasy world of Seuss At Sea<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, where your favorite books (and characters!) come to life before your eyes. And from the people-watching potential of the Lido Deck, to the see-and-be-seen White Heat Dance Club, Carnival Glory pulls out the stops. It even shows its true colors as it satisfies your stomach with sit-down dining options like the Emerald Room Steakhouse and the aptly-named Golden and Platinum Restaurants. And wait \'till you see the Camel Club Casino &mdash; proof that Carnival Glory is a real looker and a truly special cruise ship. </p>\n\n<p>Look to Carnival Glory for one vibrant time at sea. </p>\n\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/GL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-glory-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/GL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-glory-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/GL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-glory-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/GL/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-glory-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'HZ', 'name': 'Carnival Horizon', 'slug': 'carnival-horizon', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/HZ/carnival-horizon-waterworks.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Miami, FL', 'Galveston, TX'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n    <p>The line that brings the sea and the sky together inspired us... to build a ship that unites you with great fun, comfort, dining and exotic destinations. And most importantly, unites you with one another. It\'s Carnival Horizon!</p>\n    \n    <p>This ship doesn\'t just do it a little bit, either. First, Carnival Horizon goes big with an IMAX<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup> theater for true cinematic action! This ship keeps things flowing with an onboard waterpark that splashes you more than a little — Dr. Seuss WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> splashes you oodles, with a little help from the wacky characters everybody loves. Go for a bike ride way, way above it all at SkyRide<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup>. The Punchliner Comedy Club<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> and Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> are just two of your top onboard entertainment picks, and they’re both focused on uniting you with unforgettable performances up on stage.</p>\n    \n    <p>For relaxation, get to Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup>, or step up to max relaxation at Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> featuring great massages, thermal suites and more. Havana Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> &amp; Pool is a good one too &mdash; a spot that brings together stylish poolside lounging with authentically Cuban cocktails... adding hot nightlife into the mix once the sun goes down. And all day long, you know we\'ve got stuff for the kids &mdash; Carnival Horizon has three age-specific youth spaces!</p>\n    \n    <p>This ship brings tons of flavor to every meal. It starts with a guy named Guy &mdash; Fieri &mdash; who created two awesome spots on the ship: one\'s the crowd-pleasing Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup>, and the other happens to be Guy\'s Pig &amp; Anchor Smokehouse | Brewhouse<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup>, a spot that serves up BBQ classics paired with freshly-brewed-right-on-board beers. If you\'re looking for great seafood on Carnival Horizon, then Seafood Shack<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup>\'s the place to cast your net. Bonsai Teppanyaki<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> is an intimate meal and interactive performance, while Fahrenheit 555<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup> is a dining experience that stands toe-to-toe with some of the best steakhouses on land. Jiji Asian Kitchen<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup> and Cucina del Capitano<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup> each specialize in delighting certain taste buds: the ones craving pan-Asian favorites, and classic Italian dishes served family-style. (Check... and check!)</p>\n    \n    <p>Add all this together and you\'ve got... a vacation on Carnival Horizon that truly brings it all together.</p>\n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/HZ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-horizon-7.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/HZ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-horizon-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/HZ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-horizon-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/HZ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-horizon-4.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/HZ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-horizon-6.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/HZ/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-horizon-5.jpg']},
    {'code': 'JB', 'name': 'Carnival Jubilee', 'slug': 'carnival-jubilee', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/JB/carnival-jubilee/heros/carnival-jubilee-ship-aerial-hero-desktop.jpg', 'intro': ['CARNIVAL JUBILEE® SAILS FROM GALVESTON\nPACKED WITH SUCH FUN & INNOVATION'], 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Galveston, TX'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': 'Welcome — in advance — to Carnival Jubilee! The next ship in line after Mardi Gras<sup style="font-size:70%">&reg;</sup> and Carnival Celebration&trade; has some big flip-flops to fill, and you can count on Carnival Jubilee to take things to the next level with six “zones” of fun. Zones are areas themed to transform your vacation into a unique mix of experiences — hop from zone to zone throughout your day to make your own. (And two of them — <strong>Currents&trade;</strong> and <strong>The Shores&trade;</strong> — are new, oceany-fresh fun spaces.) We’re talking things like the third bistro at sea — <strong>Emeril’s Bistro 717&trade;</strong> — from our new Chief Culinary Officer; plus Carnival classics like <strong>BOLT<sup style="font-size:70%">&reg;</sup></strong>, <strong>RedFrog<sup style="font-size:70%">&reg;</sup> Tiki Bar</strong>, <strong>Family Feud&trade; Live</strong>, <strong>Cucina del Capitano<sup style="font-size:70%">&reg;</sup></strong>, <strong>Seuss at Sea&trade;</strong> and <strong>Playlist Productions&trade;</strong>. These will be joined by fresh innovations like <strong>The Golden Mermaid&trade;</strong> and <strong>Dr.Inks, Ph.D.&trade;</strong>… plus even all-new onboard fun spots. And every last one of them is powered by clean-burning LNG fuel!', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/JB/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-jubilee-6.jpg']},
    {'code': 'LE', 'name': 'Carnival Legend', 'slug': 'carnival-legend', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/LE/StateRoomCodes/LESUPRE.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Alaska', 'Bahamas', 'Caribbean', 'Europe', 'Hawaii', 'Mexico', 'Panama Canal', 'Transatlantic'], 'sail_from': ['Civitavecchia (Rome), Italy', 'Tampa, Fl', 'Seattle, WA', 'Long Beach (Los Angeles), Ca'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>\n        Legends are made, not born... and over time, this ship has become even more deserving of its nameplate. Let’s discover some of the secrets of Carnival Legend.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>\n        If you’re out to find new legends, flip directly to the RedFrog Pub<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup>, featuring not only a mythical mascot, but actual drinks — plus Caribbean atmosphere by the gallon. Your heroic journey down the Green Thunder waterslide is a saga you’ll recount for ages. Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> proves that you needn’t teach a man to fish for him to enjoy delicacies from the sea. Once you’ve had a look — not to mention a taste — at the cocktail magic of Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup>, you still may not believe your eyes. And Carnival Legend<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> even has a place for saluting some real-life heroes: Heroes Tribute<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> Bar.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>\n        This ship, which pays tribute to some of the most enduring legends throughout the ages, still features classic Carnival Legend favorites. Take a dip in the Camelot and Avalon pools, wish for fortune at Club Merlin Casino, and uncover something to savor at Truffles Restaurant. There’s more than one way to dine at Lido Deck’s Unicorn Café, including handmade faves from Guy’s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> or fresh taco-burrito goodness from BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>. And of course there’s our signature steakhouse, Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse, where the multi-course meal is no myth.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>\n        Music lovers who go for the classics will love Billie’s Piano Bar. Kids will tell and retell the tale of their favorite vacation, spent hanging out and meeting new friends at one of three supervised youth areas. And adults can get lost in a good book, or just one another’s company, at the legendarily kid-free Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>. Experience unheard-of levels of relaxation at Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>. Then, when the sun goes down, dance the night away at Medusa’s Lair Dance Club. Activities on Carnival Legend? Nothing short of legendary.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>\n        For a cruise vacation that’s sure to go down in your history books, turn to Carnival Legend.\n    </p>\n    \n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/LE/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-legend-6.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LE/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-legend-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LE/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-legend-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LE/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-legend-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'LI', 'name': 'Carnival Liberty', 'slug': 'carnival-liberty', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/LI/carnival-liberty-1.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean', 'Panama Canal'], 'sail_from': ['New Orleans, LA'], 'durations': ['6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n<p>We think you should have a great time at sea. Carnival Liberty feels the same way! This is one ship that&rsquo;s ready to put its fun where your vacation is, with plenty of ways to enjoy your time away.</p>\n\n<p>All day long, Carnival Liberty can be found serving up signature burgers designed by Guy Fieri, right there at Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> &mdash; and look! &mdash; just over there is Heroes Tribute Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, which refreshes everyone while paying tribute to men and women of the military. Enjoy BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> tacos and burritos on Lido deck &mdash; made fresh, and fast, while you wait &mdash; plus two great bars: one rum-slinging, one tequila-wielding, both dueling for your heart. That\'s right: just a quick stroll from RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> you&rsquo;ll find BlueIguana Tequila Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>.</p>\n\n<p>On the entertainment side of things, Carnival Liberty features two of our best, live on stage. First there\'s Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, where pros sing and dance their hearts out, performing high-energy themed revues of tunes you know, backed by amazing visual effects. Then there\'s Punchliner<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> Comedy Club where you\'ll find some real pros who know how to wedge a little laughter into anyone’s evening. Kids have three unique youth spaces where they can hang out with others their age and enjoy supervised activities, games and more.</p>\n\n<p>You might call Carnival Liberty a vacation spot that\'s just full of great vacation spots... and we\'d agree!</p>\n\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/LI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-liberty-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-liberty-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-liberty-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-liberty-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'LM', 'name': 'Carnival Luminosa', 'slug': 'carnival-luminosa', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/LM/Luminosa_1920_640-png.png', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Alaska', 'Hawaii', 'Mexico', 'Transpacific', 'Asia', 'Australia', 'South Pacific'], 'sail_from': ['Tokyo, Japan', 'Singapore', 'Brisbane, Australia', 'Sydney, Australia', 'San Francisco, CA', 'Hong Kong'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n<p>Step aboard Carnival Luminosa and experience hospitality and fun that\'s pure, unmistakable Carnival, with so many fan-favorite onboard features like the flavors of Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and RedFrog<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> Rum Bar; the entertainment of Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, Piano Bar 88 and The Punchliner<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Comedy Club; plus the relaxation of Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and Serenity<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. And when you&rsquo;re indoors, you can still enjoy great views and lots of natural light &mdash; the ship was built with plenty of windows.</p>\n<p>So when you choose to sail on Carnival Luminosa, can we just say&hellip; great choice! There&rsquo;s just one more decision to make: is Australia or Alaska more your cruising style? We ask because this world-traveling ship splits its time between Australia and Alaska, offering plenty of itinerary options from Australia before heading to San Francisco for Alaska cruises. And when the ship&rsquo;s heading from one region to the other, we take the opportunity to sail unique Transpacific itineraries that stop in spots like Fiji, Tahiti, Hawaii, Japan and more. So, what we&rsquo;re saying is&hellip; with scenery like this, you&rsquo;re gonna put those windows to good use!</p>\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/LM/Luminosa_1920_640-png.png', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LM/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-luminosa-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LM/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-luminosa-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LM/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-luminosa-4.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LM/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-luminosa-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/LM/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-luminosa-6.jpg']},
    {'code': 'MC', 'name': 'Carnival Magic', 'slug': 'carnival-magic', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/MC/StateRoomCodes/MCSUSUL.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Miami, FL'], 'durations': ['6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>We knew exactly what we were doing when we named this ship Carnival Magic... and we\'re sure you\'ll agree.</p>\n    \n    <p>At 1,004 feet, this one continued the <em>Dream</em> class tradition of large-scale, bow-to-stern cruise ship fun including the food-and-entertainment space Ocean Plaza, the splashy stylings of Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>... and The Lanai, a convenient, scenic half-mile outdoor wraparound promenade deck. In other words, a cruise on Carnival Magic has no shortage of its namesake charm!</p>\n    \n    <p>It\'s no surprise Carnival Magic debuted all-new ways to have a good time onboard, and continues to prove it with the outdoor fitness-and-fun of SportSquare<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, featuring the world\'s first ropes course at sea. This is also the ship that introduced the world to Cucina del Capitano<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup>, which serves up Italian favorites fit for a captain. Who can forget their first taste of RedFrog Pub<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup>, with its laid back, not-a-worry-to-be-found atmosphere... plus its exclusive, tasty, not-a-drop-to-be-found (on land, that is) beer, ThirstyFrog<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> Red. And if you wanted to visit the original Guy\'s Pig &amp; Anchor Bar-B-Que Smokehouse<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>... guess which ship you\'d check out!</p>\n    \n    <p>Keeping with the times, Carnival Magic features the delicious good times of Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> and RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup>.</p>\n    \n    <p>Carnival Magic has a history of starting good things... and sharing them with guests.</p>\n    \n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/MC/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-magic-7.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MC/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-magic-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MC/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-magic-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MC/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-magic-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'MI', 'name': 'Carnival Miracle', 'slug': 'carnival-miracle', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/MI/carnival-miracle-1.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean', 'Europe', 'Panama Canal', 'Transatlantic'], 'sail_from': ['Seattle, WA', 'Galveston, TX', 'Lisbon, Portugal', 'Dover (London), England', 'Civitavecchia (Rome), Italy', 'Baltimore, Md'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>Carnival Miracle is a ship you may not believe when you see... but definitely don\'t miss seeing it!</p>\n    \n    <p>When we say that Carnival Miracle takes you to another world, we mean that in every sense. Not only does this ship visit stunning destinations, but features incredible onboard spaces inspired by elements of fantasy. Escape from reality as you take in a show at the Phantom Lounge or a dance at Dr. Frankenstein\'s Lab. To lose yourself in a song, find your way to Sam\'s Piano Bar. Hungry? You\'ll find great food all over the place, from the casual fare of Horatio\'s to the artful eats of the Bacchus and Ariadne dining rooms... not to mention the world-class cuts at Nick &amp; Nora\'s Steakhouse.</p>\n    \n    <p>At Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup> we make drinks into art, while the laid-back RedFrog Pub<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> has "Caribbean cool" down to a science.And at Heroes Tribute Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, we\'re always raising a glass to those who matter. Outdoors there\'s fun to be had, whether you\'re down for watersliding or up for simply sunning &mdash; Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> has you covered (in water, that is), and the Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> will get you relaxing in the sun or the shade, grown-up-style.</p>\n    \n    <p>No matter your age, don\'t forget: the sweetest way to cap off the day is with a treat from Cherry On Top<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup>, our onboard candy-and-more store.</p>\n    \n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/MI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-miracle-8.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-miracle-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-miracle-6.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-miracle-7.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MI/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-miracle-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'PO', 'name': 'Carnival Panorama', 'slug': 'carnival-panorama', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/PO/carnival-panorama/heros/carnival-panorama-ship-aerial-hero-2.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Mexico'], 'sail_from': ['Long Beach (Los Angeles), Ca'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n    \n    <p>There just isn’t enough vacation time to do everything, so we go for the widest variety, make the most of the moments... and above all, try to have the most fun whenever possible. All of you with the heads nodding, hands raised, folks who just stood up and cheered at the office — you’re Carnival Panorama’s people!</p>\n\n    <p>This ship packs all the best, most delicious fun from her sister ships Carnival Vista<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> and Carnival Horizon<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, but still manages to stand out. One example: it’s easy to stand out when you’re literally flying, and Carnival Panorama has the only Sky Zone<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> trampoline park you’ll find at sea. This spot gives a whole new meaning to leaving the land behind, so lose the shoes and gain some air with gravity-defying dodgeball sessions or slam-dunk basketball experiences. That’s not the only way to catch some air, either, because this ship also features SkyRide<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, a pedal-powered suspended bike experience that’ll have you enjoying wide, breezy views of the ocean. Plus there’s a ropes course, mini-golf and WaterWorks<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> waterpark, of course!</p>\n\n    <p>It’s not all action, though, because relaxation options like Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> are on the menu. Great dining is too, with choices that range from the refined fare of Bonsai Teppanyaki<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse to come-as-hungry-as-you-are classics like BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, Guy’s Pig & Anchor Smokehouse | Brewhouse and Seafood Shack<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. (And at Guy’s, the brews are as fresh as the food, all of which are made on board.) Havana Bar & Pool are there to give you a bit of that “90 miles south” flavor and flair, with matching stateroom options that keep you close to the action all cruise long.</p>\n\n    <p>There’s traditional Carnival fun too, and these fan-favorites are great news for everybody! Three age-perfect youth programs keep kids busy having a blast with their peers, while Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> take songs you know and make high-energy crowd-pleasing shows out of them. Dive-In Movies makes a big production out of the big screen over the pool, plus The Punchliner Comedy Club<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> features family-friendly shows… and, uh, late-night shows for after the kids go to bed.</p>\n\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/PO/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-panorama-10.jpg']},
    {'code': 'PA', 'name': 'Carnival Paradise', 'slug': 'carnival-paradise', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/PA/StateRoomCodes/PASUSUO.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Tampa, Fl'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>We broke the mold after we made this one. The final Fantasy class cruise ship ever created, Carnival Paradise is proof that there\'s plenty of fun to be found long before you reach your dream destination.</p>\n    \n    <p>This ship remains classic Carnival — fun-packed from bow to stern — but on the other hand, we\'ve never stopped adding fresh new features. So now you can grab something cold, or sweet… or maybe even hot, at JavaBlue<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Café. Meet the new Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, featuring a full menu of, ahhh, spa treatments. We also added a Bonsai Sushi Express<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, so you can take your fresh sushi, sashimi, rolls and more, to go, someplace fun.</p>\n    \n    <p>By the way, on Carnival Paradise you\'ll find great times in and near the H2O courtesy of pools, hot tubs and even a Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> waterpark featuring a huge spiraling slide, plus a pair of racing slides. At Seuss at Sea<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> the characters always make a splash with an interactive storytime and parade, plus this ship features three age-perfect youth programs. Great live entertainment, like The Punchliner Comedy Club<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and piano bar, happens up on stage… bravo!</p>\n    \n    <p>\n        If you\'re talking tasty classics, you\'re going to find two of our top casual spots: Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, featuring the goods from Guy Fieri, and BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, with authentic south-of-the-border taco/burrito goodness. Refreshments — and good times — abound with RedFrog Rum Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> and BlueIguana Tequila Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. And a little closer to home (well, your vacation home), Carnival Paradise features even more balcony staterooms than before. Feel that breeze!\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>Spend a vacation aboard Carnival Paradise, and you\'ll find a little slice of cruise paradise at sea.</p>\n\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/PA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-paradise-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/PA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-paradise-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/PA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-paradise-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/PA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-paradise-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'PR', 'name': 'Carnival Pride', 'slug': 'carnival-pride', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/PR/carnival-pride-atrium-desktop.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Bermuda', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Baltimore, Md'], 'durations': ['6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>\n        Carnival Pride charms, alright — it\'s a treat for your eyes, your taste buds... and of course, your fun buds. Invite them all to come enjoy the vacation that this ship is proud to offer.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>\n        Carnival Pride invites you to dine refined, from the zen-like simplicity of Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> to the art deco ocean liner inspiration of the Normandie Restaurant, to the American-Traditional style of Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse. And of course there\'s real, delectable substance under all that style. But for something a little more casual, loosen your tie... or maybe just throw it away and grab a main course (and fries) from our main man Guy Fieri, at Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. The Mexican heat\'s optional at BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, but make your next stop Cherry on Top<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> — our candy-and-more store — where everything\'s sweet. And to raise a glass to important sacrifices of the past, Heroes Tribute Bar makes remembrance its primary objective.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>\n        You\'ll find yourself with room to move at the Beauties Dance Club, and a hard time sitting still at Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. All around this cruise ship you\'ll discover even more ways to stay cool, like an adult-only pool at Serenity, a fun-only midship pool featuring a retractable roof, plus Carnival Pride\'s splashy onboard waterpark, Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>. And if all the waterslide action leaves you needing a little extra unwinding, we recommend you dry off and head to the Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p>\n        Alongside the pool is the big-screen, big-fun Carnival Seaside Theater<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, while Seuss at Sea<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> is a good time for kids who love a good rhyme too. (Like we do!) Camp Ocean<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, Circle "C"<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> and Club O2<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> prove that we\'ve got spots for cool kids of all ages.\n    </p>\n    \n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/PR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-pride-8.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/PR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-pride-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/PR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-pride-6.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/PR/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-pride-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'RD', 'name': 'Carnival Radiance', 'slug': 'carnival-radiance', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/RD/carnival-radiance-aerial-hero-mobile.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Hawaii', 'Mexico'], 'sail_from': ['Long Beach (Los Angeles), Ca'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\r\n    <p>\r\n    The warmth of being together — it\'s just so nice, right? It fact, it inspired us to create Carnival Radiance, to delight folks like you and your closest travel buds. And wouldn\'t you believe it, Carnival Radiance makes it all happen with a little help from some friends…\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>\r\n    For starters, can we just say how excited we are to be tipping things off with the culinary influence of Shaq? This man knows his fried chicken, and in case you have any doubt, every meal we serve at Big Chicken puts the proof on your plate. Still on the taste tip, there\'s two delicious spots on Carnival Radiance from Mr. Fieri himself: Guy\'s Burger Joint and Guy\'s Pig & Anchor Bar-B-Que Smokehouse. We\'re not going to apologize for all the bragging about our famous friends. Not when there\'s so much onboard fun for kids courtesy of Dr. Seuss<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> favorites like The Cat in the Hat… who you\'ll meet! And with all the flavor from our own homegrown RedFrog and BlueIguana spots — like tacos, pub grub and great drinks — you\'ll be thrilled to get acquainted with such colorful creatures. (And the cuddly ones at Build-A-Bear Workshop<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> At Sea!)\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>\r\n    Big names aren\'t all there is to know about Carnival Radiance. There\'s amazing entertainment up on stage at Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, so many chances to be a champion at SportSquare<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> featuring our Ropes Course, and potentially unlimited relaxation potential for grown-ups at Serenity<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Adult-Only Retreat. Plus the adults have plenty of spots for a drink, like the fan-favorite Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and Heroes Tribute<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Bar, which refreshes everyone while paying tribute to men and women of the military. For the kids, don\'t worry — there\'s three youth spaces where you can hang out with others your age, plus we\'ve got real Zumbini<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> classes for the even-littler ones.\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>\r\n    But since we\'re talking together-time, your whole bunch will never run out of stuff to do on Carnival Radiance! Let\'s highlight some of the togetherest: Dive-In Movies<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> screens flicks everybody loves poolside, while at mini-golf you\'re always guaranteed to sink a hole-in-some… and really, who doesn\'t love select family-friendly comedy shows at Punchliner<sup style="font-size:12px; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Comedy Club?\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>\r\n    We\'re so excited about Carnival Radiance bringing all this fun together… emphasis on the “together.” (And the fun!) So come join us!\r\n    </p>\r\n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/RD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-radiance-7.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/RD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-radiance-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/RD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-radiance-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/RD/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-radiance-6.jpg']},
    {'code': 'SP', 'name': 'Carnival Spirit', 'slug': 'carnival-spirit', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/SP/carnival-spirit-1.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Alaska', 'Bahamas', 'Caribbean', 'Hawaii', 'Panama Canal'], 'sail_from': ['Mobile, AL', 'Seattle, WA', 'Galveston, TX', 'Tampa, Fl'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n<p>Carnival Spirit is more than a ship, but an unforgettable vacation experience you&rsquo;ll be reliving for a long time. Whether you&rsquo;re after something that&rsquo;s action-packed or just want to relax and unwind, this ship has what you&rsquo;re looking for. (Our suggestion: choose both!)</p>\n<p>There&rsquo;s heaps of fun to be had, and there&rsquo;s definitely something in it for everyone; little ones, big ones and the whole family. We&rsquo;re talking about a mini-golf course, two-deck fitness center, jogging track, Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, pools, a spa and more. And playing it cool isn&rsquo;t hard at WaterWorks<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> &mdash; after all, you&rsquo;re among waterslides like Green Thunder &mdash; plus you can always cool down, or warm up, with a dip in our domed swimming pool. Keep the kids entertained with three age-appropriate youth programs that give them plenty of choice on activities and fun chances to make new friends.</p>\n<p>Our recommendation: sail hungry. After all, you&rsquo;ll be enjoying meals in three-course style in the Empire Restaurant or just go ahead and build a meal with as many courses as you like at the casual-style, variety-packed Lido Restaurant. Speaking of casual, the trio of RedFrog<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> Pub, Guy&rsquo;s Burger Joint and BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> each put their own delicious spins on flavor itself. To get a little fancy, sit down at Nouveau Steakhouse. To get a lot un-fancy &mdash; and we mean this in the most delicious way possible &mdash; check out late-night soft-serve or pizza!</p>\n<p>When the sun goes down, the fun&rsquo;s over. Nope, just kidding! Carnival Spirit features bars and lounges, plus entertainment  that&rsquo;s great for when you&rsquo;re feeling like live comedy, musical performances and more. Feel like helping out a little? All the vocal cords are encouraged to participate at the piano bar. Feeling lucky? The casino&rsquo;s right over there.</p>\n<p>Carnival Spirit is no stranger to amazing vacations&hellip; and hopes you won&rsquo;t be a stranger either!\n</p>\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/SP/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-spirit-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SP/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-spirit-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SP/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-spirit-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SP/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-spirit-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'SL', 'name': 'Carnival Splendor', 'slug': 'carnival-splendor', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/SL/carnival-splendor-3.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Asia', 'Australia', 'New Zealand', 'South Pacific'], 'sail_from': ['Sydney, Australia', 'Singapore', 'Hong Kong'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}},
    {'code': 'SN', 'name': 'Carnival Sunrise', 'slug': 'carnival-sunrise', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/SN/carnival-sunrise-2.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Miami, FL'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        Catching a great sunrise isn\'t just for early-risers. Carnival Sunrise has enough warm fun for everybody to bask in. \r\n    </p>\r\n    \r\n    <p>\r\n        So, everybody — here\'s a little of what you can expect from Carnival Sunrise. If you\'re ready for some amazing things to do let\'s start with the musical stage-show stylings of <strong>Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>. Also up on stage find laugh-out-loud performances at <strong>Punchliner<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> Comedy Club</strong>. Kids get to have a blast with others their age at one of <strong>three youth spaces</strong>, while adults will find <strong>Piano Bar 88<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> a melodious place to grab a drink in the evening. And who doesn\'t love a good waterslide? <strong>Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> is the ship\'s designated splash zone.\r\n    </p>\r\n    \r\n    <p>\r\n        <strong>RedFrog Pub<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></strong> could be called Carnival Sunrise\'s center of good cheer and great beers! For delicious bites served with that same casual, can-do-fun attitude, look to <strong>Guy\'s Pig & Anchor Bar-B-Que Smokehouse | Brewhouse<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>. Or for something a little more refined, swing by <strong>Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>. And for doing the ever-important — but also fun — work of saluting heroes, raise a glass at the <strong>Heroes Tribute Bar</strong>. Fancying things up a little are the Italian classics of <strong>Cucina del Capitano<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></strong>, while another notch up you\'ll find <strong>Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>.\r\n    </p>\r\n    \r\n    <p>\r\n        We think you see by now that, from sun-up to sunset and well into the night, you\'ll find a day aboard Carnival Sunrise full of amazing ways to have fun. (Plus, don\'t forget the amazing destinations to see!) Best of all, at the end of the day... remember that your vacation on Carnival Sunrise features another great one tomorrow.\r\n    </p>\r\n    \r\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/SN/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunrise-8.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SN/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunrise-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SN/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunrise-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SN/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunrise-7.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SN/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunrise-5.jpg']},
    {'code': 'SH', 'name': 'Carnival Sunshine', 'slug': 'carnival-sunshine', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/SH/carnival-sunshine-ropes-course-desktop.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Bermuda', 'Canada/New England', 'Caribbean', 'Europe', 'Panama Canal', 'Transatlantic'], 'sail_from': ['Norfolk, VA', 'Dover (London), England', 'Barcelona, Spain', 'Civitavecchia (Rome), Italy', 'Galveston, TX'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n<p>Everything the sunlight touches on Carnival Sunshine has been doused with an extra dose of fun. There\'s plenty to find atop this ship, where you can spend your days being kissed by the warm rays of the sun. Visit the biggest Serenity area ever, featuring three decks, plenty of recliners... and even a waterfall. Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, our onboard waterpark, doesn\'t just deliver the favorites... this one debuted the slick Speedway Splash slide. There\'s also SportSquare<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, where you can let your inner champion run free (around the jogging track), traverse the Ropes Course high up above, or even engage in a little one-on-one, from ping pong to foosball to giant chess.</p>\n\n<p>When you\'re on your Carnival Sunshine cruise, step out of the sun and try out some shade (and it\'s some pretty cool shade, at that). The first thing you\'ll see is the Sunshine Atrium... and let\'s just say first impressions count. From there, check out dining options &mdash; this ship has everything under the Carnival sun &mdash; like Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and JiJi Asian Kitchen<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>. Some of the greatest Carnival bars are here: RedFrog Pub<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>, BlueIguana Tequila Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, SkyBox<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Sports Bar and Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup>... plus the already-classic Havana Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>! You\'ll enjoy musical revues from Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>, where songs you know and love come to life on stage.</p>\n\n<p>When you find yourself between the Carnival Sunshine and some actual sunshine, fun at sea is guaranteed.</p>\n\n</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/SH/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunshine-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SH/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunshine-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SH/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunshine-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/SH/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-sunshine-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'TL', 'name': 'Carnival Tropicale', 'slug': 'carnival-tropicale', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/TL/carnival-tropicale/heros/carnival-tropicale-hero-desktop.jpg', 'intro': '', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Galveston, TX'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}},
    {'code': 'VA', 'name': 'Carnival Valor', 'slug': 'carnival-valor', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/VA/carnival-valor-2.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean', 'Panama Canal'], 'sail_from': ['New Orleans, LA', 'Mobile, AL'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days', '10+ Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\n\n    <p>Your high seas hero Carnival Valor is here to rescue you from ordinary vacations and whisk you away to leisure, fun... and amazing destinations.</p>\n    \n    <p>On your way you\'ll find onboard food spots designed to regale your palate, like BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> and Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;  line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>... plus the downright indulgent Scarlett\'s Steakhouse. And if you are thirsty, let yourself be swept away to RedFrog Pub<sup style="font-size: 70%;  line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> or Alchemy Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;  line-height:12px;">&reg;</sup> for a drink.</p>\n    \n    <p>Kids can get caught up in all the excitement of being kids, hanging with others their age at Carnival Valor\'s three supervised youth spaces. Or they can join the wacky, wonderful Dr. Seuss<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> bunch for character story-time (and more!) at Seuss at Sea<sup style="font-size: 70%;  line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup>.</p>\n    \n    <p>On the entertainment front, Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%;  line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> takes tunes you know and presents them in song-and-dance, up-on-stage spectacular shows. At Dive-In Movies, you\'ll never have to choose between making a splash and watching a favorite movie under the stars, up on the big screen. And our Punchliner<sup style="font-size: 70%;  line-height:12px;">&trade;</sup> Comedy Club will have you laughing your flippy-floppies off..</p> \n    \n    <p>If you thought for a second your vacation might be boring, now you know not to fear &mdash; Carnival Valor has what it takes to save any vacation!</p>\n    \n    </blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/VA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-valor-5.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/VA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-valor-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/VA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-valor-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/VA/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-valor-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'VX', 'name': 'Carnival Venezia', 'slug': 'carnival-venezia', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/VX/open-for-sale/carnival-venezia-canal-grande-desktop-hero-2.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Bermuda', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Manhattan, New York City, NY', 'Port Canaveral (Orlando), Fl', 'Miami, FL'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<style>\n    .emojiResize {\n        width: 16px;\n        height: 16px;\n    }\n    \n    </style>\n<blockquote>\n    <p>\n      It\'s a long way from Venice to the U.S., but Carnival Venezia makes it feel like the two are next-door neighbors. You\'re going to find that all that <span style="font-style: italic;">stile Italiano</span>\xa0truly spans continents.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        What can you expect to find in this ship? Well, there’s more than a little Italy in this one — that’s why we’re calling this new type of cruising <strong>Fun Italian Style<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>. It starts with the Venice-inspired atrium <strong>Piazza San Marco</strong>, the onboard flavor and flair continues at the three-course <strong>Marco Polo</strong> and <strong>Canal Grande Restaurants</strong>, <strong>La Strada Grill<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and its Italian street food, plus fusion spots <strong>Tomodoro<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> (Mexican-Italian, yum!) and <strong>Guy’s Burger Joint</strong> (new burgers with Italian flavors — also yum!). And in authentic <span style="font-style: italic;">ristorante</span> style, the elevated Italian of <strong>Il Viaggio</strong>. Sip well at bars that each specialize in their own thing: complex and sophisticated cocktails at <strong>Amari<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, bubbly stuff (plus snacks and coffee) at <strong>Frizzante<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, frozen everything at <strong>Rococó<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and fine Italian wines at <strong>Carnevale Bar & Lounge<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>. There’s great entertainment at the red-velvety <strong>Teatro Rosso</strong> and its <strong>Playlist Productions<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> shows, plus <strong>Gondola Lounge</strong> was inspired by the famous canals of Venice. <strong>Terrazza staterooms</strong> are a whole new way to stay in style and comfort, all in a great location close to amenities like the exclusive <strong>Terrazza Carnevale</strong>, a private terrace deck made for lounging, sipping and fun, day or night!\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        There’s also a lot of the classic Carnival fun that repeat cruisers (&#128075; ciao!) know and love. Deliciously familiar flavors come from spots like <strong>Bonsai Teppanyaki<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and <strong>Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, while celebration spots include <strong>Piano Bar 88</strong> and <strong>Serenity Bar</strong>, and relaxation happens at <strong>Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and <strong>Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>. For the kids, there’s spaces just right for their age like <strong>Camp Ocean<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong>, <strong>Circle “C”<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup></strong> and <strong>Club O2<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&reg;</sup></strong>. And outdoors, get ready for a very splashy <strong>WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> and <strong>SportSquare<sup style="font-size: 70%; line-height: 12px;">&trade;</sup></strong> featuring a ropes course, jogging track, mini golf and outdoor fitness center.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        So as we were saying… Carnival Venezia and all this <strong>Fun Italian Style</strong> are sailing now. <span style="font-style: italic;">Andiamo!</span>\n    </p>\n</blockquote>\n\n', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/VX/Itinerary/carnival-ships-venezia-itinerary-3.jpg']},
    {'code': 'VS', 'name': 'Carnival Vista', 'slug': 'carnival-vista', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/VS/carnival-vista-skyride-html.jpg', 'intro': 'INSIDE THIS SHIP\n\nJust like a delicious cake, your ship is made of layers. Find out which fun ingredients — staterooms, dining, activities — go into each deck.\n\nDOWNLOAD PDF', 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Port Canaveral (Orlando), Fl'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': '<blockquote>\r\n\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\tWe\'ve built a lot of ships over the years, but for a truly unique experience at sea, you\'ve gotta see Carnival Vista. Carnival Vista has a whole new relationship to the sea, and you get to experience this as you explore the Caribbean with all-new views.\r\n\t</p>\r\n\t\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\tIt\'s only natural that you\'ll want to start outdoors… so let\'s. Wait, are those flying bicycles? Pretty much! <strong>SkyRide<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></strong> at <strong>SportSquare<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> is a twin-track suspended bike course — strap in and race around for the win or just cruise for great views. At <strong>Havana Bar<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup> & Pool</strong> you\'ll find an island retreat that evokes classic Cuban-style lounging with an emphasis on style... and on views, and on traditional cocktails! <strong>Carnival WaterWorks<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> is packed to the gills with wet ways to get-a-splashin\', including <strong>Kaleid-O-Slide<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>, which adds funky light and color effects to the \'speed-n-splash\' story. If you can\'t get enough Guy Fieri, we invite you to try at <strong>Guy\'s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> and <strong>Guy\'s Pig & Anchor Smokehouse<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>. Rounding out this ship\'s sunlight highlights is <strong>Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>, the low-key grown-up spot that\'s more ‘lounging and hot tubs’ than ‘action and adventure.’ (But Serenity\'s complimentary chopped salad station gets our inner grown-up excited!)\r\n\t</p>\r\n\t\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\tIndoors, things are every bit as cool. Take <strong>RedFrog Pub & Brewery<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></strong> for example — our Caribbean-cool pub has an onboard brewery producing exclusive craft beers you can enjoy just feet from the brewing kettle. We love to toast to what matters, so <strong>Heroes Tribute Bar</strong> was made for honoring service members. If you do seafood, you\'ll want to try <strong>Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> or the seaside <strong>Seafood Shack<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong>, while <strong>JiJi Asian Kitchen<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></strong> and <strong>Cucina del Capitano<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></strong> satisfy cuisine-specific cravings. Of course Carnival Vista features a <strong>Dr. Seuss Bookville<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> and youth activities for all kinds of kids (the smallers, the tallers and the in-betweeners). On the stateroom side, Carnival Vista adds new types of rooms to the mix: <strong>Family Harbor</strong> is a special area reserved for families and features a private lounge. All <strong>Havana staterooms</strong> and suites are located just off the <strong>Havana Bar & Pool</strong> and feature a unique tropical décor, while <strong>Havana Cabanas</strong> add a patio with hammock chair!\r\n\t</p>\r\n\t\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\tOne last thing you should know: on Carnival Vista more onboard places than ever before span the indoors and outdoors — so whether you set the thermostat to \'cool-and-crisp\' or \'sea-breezy perfection\' you\'ll enjoy your kind of Caribbean comfort on Carnival Vista.\r\n\t</p>\r\n\t\r\n\t</blockquote>', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/VS/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-vista-6.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/VS/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-vista-2.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/VS/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-vista-3.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/VS/Itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-vista-4.jpg']},
    {'code': 'MD', 'name': 'Mardi Gras', 'slug': 'mardi-gras', 'hero_image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/mardi-gras/heros/mardi-gras-ship-hero-2.png', 'intro': ['MARDI GRAS® IS A NOD TO WHERE WE’VE BEEN\n…AND A SALUTE TO WHERE WE’RE HEADED.'], 'compare': {'sail_to': ['Bahamas', 'Caribbean'], 'sail_from': ['Port Canaveral (Orlando), Fl'], 'durations': ['2-5 Days', '6-9 Days']}, 'long_desc_html': 'When we launched our first ship, 1972\'s <em>TSS Mardi Gras</em>, we made cruising a lot less stuffy, a bit less fancy, the kind of fun everybody could enjoy. Nobody expected this ship to change the cruise world, but... here we are! So here’s a brand-new ship with a familiar name. With this <em>Mardi Gras<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></em> we aren\'t just paying homage to our first ship — in cruising circles this name suggests innovation, signals the start of something big. Oh, and this <em>Mardi Gras</em> still shouts “fun!” at the top of its lungs. This ship introduced <strong>Zones</strong> — six themed areas packed with brand-new experiences for eating, drinking and spectacularly getting down to fun. There\'s <strong>BOLT<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&reg;</sup></strong>, the first-ever rollercoaster at sea, <strong>Emeril\'s Bistro 1396<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> from yes-that-Emeril, <strong>Family Feud<sup style="font-size: 70%;">&trade;</sup></strong> Live for everybody... plus incredible new bars like <strong>The Brass Magnolia</strong> and <strong>Fortune Teller</strong>. Everybody can enjoy <em>Mardi Gras</em>. Come on down!', 'hero_images': ['/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-mardi-gras-1.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-mardi-gras-12.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-mardi-gras-8.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-mardi-gras-9.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-mardi-gras-13.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-mardi-gras-10.jpg', '/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/itinerary/carnival-ships-itinerary-mardi-gras-7.jpg']},
]
