    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\nNext items in the Carousel\n1\n2\nINTERIOR\nAn Interior stateroom is the most affordable way\xa0to cruise without leaving out the comfort or convenience! Great for curling up after a long day of fun.\n\nEvery room includes:\n\nDedicated stateroom attendant\nSoft, cozy linens\nPlenty of closet and drawer space\nIn-room safe for valuables\nTelevision\nStateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 0},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Porthole', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Porthole\n                        A pair of round windows in your Porthole stateroom give you the classic seafarer’s view times two, a view of the ocean without breaking the budget.\xa0\xa0\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 1},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Ocean View', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Ocean View\n                        Your picture window gives you views of scenery you won’t find anywhere on land, all from the comfort of your Ocean View stateroom.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 2},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Ocean View (Obstructed View)', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Ocean View (Obstructed View)\n                        Your picture window gives you a view beyond your comfy Ocean View stateroom, while letting sunlight stream in. (Note: view will be obstructed.)\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 3},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Aft-View Extended Balcony', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Aft-View Extended Balcony\n                        Aft-View Extended Balcony staterooms feature a larger balcony for more lounge-around room, plus these rooms face backward (most balconies face left or right), so you’ll get a unique view of your ship's gentle wake.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 4},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Balcony', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Balcony\n                        Balcony staterooms were designed for maximum sea breeze and the most stunning views. Cruise with a view and be just steps away from your own personal outdoor oasis.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 5},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Byron Beach Presidential Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Byron Beach Presidential Suite\n                        There's only one Byron Beach Presidential Suite on the ship, so book early if you're looking for the ultimate in luxury! This apartment-style suite features premium perks and an aft-facing balcony, plus the comfort and convenience of a separate living room, dining area... and then there's bathroom upgrades like a large shower and separate toilet room with a second sink. And don't forget, your suite includes access to the Byron Beach Club and more exclusive perks!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to Byron Beach Presidential Suite:\n    \n        \n            Wine and welcome treat upon arrival\n            Complimentary room service (regular bar prices apply for beverages)\n            Complimentary minibar selection (water and soft drinks)\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all Byron Beach suites include:\n    \n        \n            Complimentary access to Byron Beach Club\n            Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n            Exclusive breakfast at Angelo’s\n            Complimentary in-suite continental breakfast menu\n            Exclusive spa discounts on treatments during port days\n            In-suite coffee machine\n            Byron Beach Club bathrobes and slippers to use during the cruise\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all suites include:\n    \n        \n            Priority check-in and boarding\n            Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n            Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times\n                later than 9:30 AM\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n            Two large bottles of water\n            Pillow-top mattress\n            Curated in-stateroom bath products\n            Bathrobes\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 6},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-adventure', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Byron Beach Extended Balcony Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Byron Beach Extended Balcony Suite\n                        A Byron Beach Extended Balcony Suite puts its proudest perk right in the name. (Feel that breeze!) Inside you'll also find a sitting area, walk-in closet and deluxe bathroom with a tub. And don't forget, your suite includes access to the Byron Beach Club and more exclusive perks!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to Byron Beach suites:\n    \n        \n            Complimentary access to Byron Beach Club\n            Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n            Exclusive breakfast at Angelo’s\n            Complimentary in-suite continental breakfast menu\n            Exclusive spa discounts on treatments during port days\n            In-suite coffee machine\n            Byron Beach Club bathrobes and slippers to use during the cruise\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all suites include:\n    \n        \n            Priority check-in and boarding\n            Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n            Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times\n                later than 9:30 AM\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n            Two large bottles of water\n            Pillow-top mattress\n            Curated in-stateroom bath products\n            Bathrobes\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 7},
