    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior with Picture Window (Walkway View)', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\nNext items in the Carousel\n1\n2\nINTERIOR WITH PICTURE WINDOW (WALKWAY VIEW)\nYour picture window gives you a view beyond your stateroom, to the observation deck outside, including a great sky view. (Note: view will be partially obstructed.)\n\nEvery room includes:\n\nDedicated stateroom attendant\nSoft, cozy linens\nPlenty of closet and drawer space\nIn-room safe for valuables\nTelevision\nStateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 0},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Interior\n                        This is an affordable way to cruise without leaving out the comfort or convenience! Great for curling up after a long day of fun.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 1},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Porthole', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Porthole\n                        A pair of round windows in your room give you the classic seafarer’s view times two, a view of the ocean without breaking the budget.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 2},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior Upper/Lower (Porthole)', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Interior Upper/Lower (Porthole)\n                        These staterooms are great for a pair of cruisers on a budget, creatively maximizing space with a different layout — one Twin bed, and either an upper Pullman or sofa bed, plus an added touch: round windows provide a view of the ocean.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 3},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior Upper/Lower', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Interior Upper/Lower\n                        These staterooms are great for a pair of cruisers on a budget, creatively maximizing space with a different layout — featuring one Twin bed, and either an upper Pullman or sofa bed.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 4},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Scenic Ocean View', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Scenic Ocean View\n                        Your Scenic Ocean View stateroom aboard Carnival Conquest provides the best view of the sea that lies ahead of the ship, with views unlike any on land. And you'll get more of them, too, with floor-to-ceiling windows providing plenty of looking-glass for gazing at the natural wonders of the sea... and let's not forget sunrise and sunset.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 5},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Ocean View', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Ocean View\n                        A picture window gives you views of scenery you won’t find anywhere on land, all from the comfort of your stateroom.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 6},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Ocean View (Obstructed View)', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Ocean View (Obstructed View)\n                        A picture window gives you views of scenery you won’t find anywhere on land, all from the comfort of your stateroom. (Note: view will be partially obstructed.)\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 7},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Premium Vista Balcony', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Premium Vista Balcony\n                        Premium Vista Balcony staterooms were designed to wrap around the aft corners of Carnival Conquest, giving you a unique vantage point from which to enjoy luxuriously panoramic views of the sky and the sea — and yes, take in even more of that sunshine.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 8},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Premium Balcony', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Premium Balcony\n                        Step into a Premium Balcony stateroom aboard Carnival Conquest and it’s easy to see exactly what you're getting: one seriously spacious stateroom. It's about more than just the room itself, you'll find... step onto your oversized balcony and you'll find that when there's a sea breeze in your hair, there's no limit to the relaxation you can have.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 9},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Aft-View Extended Balcony', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Aft-View Extended Balcony\n                        Aft-View Extended Balcony staterooms feature a larger balcony for more lounge-around room, more kick-back space... not to even mention some of the best stern-side views you'll find anywhere. Get ready to relax as you gaze upon Carnival Conquest's gentle wake from your spacious balcony.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 10},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Balcony', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Balcony\n                        Balcony staterooms were designed for maximum sea breeze and the most stunning views, so look to a balcony if you're looking to cruise aboard Carnival Conquest. Any time you're in your room, you're just steps away from your own personal outdoor oasis, featuring the sort of sea view you can also feel.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 11},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': "Captain's Suite", 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel123\n\n\n                        Captain's Suite\n                        This is the best room you can get… without bunking up with the guy himself.  A Captain’s Suite aboard Carnival Conquest features tons of indoor space, and a huge balcony when you need a little more. Back inside you’ll find a king-size bed, two full bathrooms (one with whirlpool tub), plus a separate living room that sleeps another three. And VIP check-in? Naturally.\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to suites:\n    \n         Priority check-in and boarding\n         Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n         Priority Main Dining Room time assignment\n         Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n         Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times later than 9:30 AM\n         Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n         Two large bottles of water\n         Pillow-top mattress\n         Curated in-stateroom bath products\n         Bathrobes\n    \n  \n  \n  \n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n      Dedicated stateroom attendant\n      \n        Soft, cozy linens\n      \n      Plenty of closet and drawer space\n      In-room safe for valuables\n      Television\n      Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 12},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Grand Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Grand Suite\n                        A Grand Suite aboard Carnival Conquest features even more space than the standard suite — plenty of room in your room! This stateroom is loaded for an unparalleled experience: VIP check-in, a huge balcony, and even a convenient dressing area with vanity.\n                            \n  Amenities exclusive to suites:\n  \n       Priority check-in and boarding\n       Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n       Priority Main Dining Room time assignment\n       Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n       Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times later than 9:30 AM\n       Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n       Two large bottles of water\n       Pillow-top mattress\n       Curated in-stateroom bath products\n       Bathrobes\n  \n\n\n\n  Plus, every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 13},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-conquest', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Ocean Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Ocean Suite\n                        A Carnival Conquest suite is the ultimate way to cruise. With more space for stretching out indoors, plus a large balcony for kicking back outdoors, try an Ocean Suite to experience private, luxurious relaxation. Ocean Suites also include VIP check-in, walk-in closet and bathroom with whirlpool tub.\n                            \n  Amenities exclusive to suites:\n  \n       Priority check-in and boarding\n       Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n       Priority Main Dining Room time assignment\n       Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n       Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times later than 9:30 AM\n       Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n       Two large bottles of water\n       Pillow-top mattress\n       Curated in-stateroom bath products\n       Bathrobes\n  \n\n\n\n  Plus, every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    \n      Soft, cozy linens\n    \n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 14},
