    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-encounter', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Byron Beach Presidential Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Byron Beach Presidential Suite\n                        There's only one Byron Beach Presidential Suite on the ship, so book early if you're looking for the ultimate in luxury! This apartment-style suite features premium perks and an aft-facing balcony, plus the comfort and convenience of a separate living room, dining area... and then there's bathroom upgrades like a large shower and separate toilet room with a second sink. And don't forget, your suite includes access to the Byron Beach Club and more exclusive perks!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to Byron Beach Presidential Suite:\n    \n        \n            Wine and welcome treat upon arrival \n            Complimentary room service (regular bar prices apply for beverages)\n            Complimentary minibar selection (water and soft drinks)\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all Byron Beach suites include:\n    \n        \n            Complimentary access to Byron Beach Club\n            Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n            Exclusive breakfast at Angelo’s\n            Complimentary in-suite continental breakfast menu\n            Exclusive spa discounts on treatments during port days\n            In-suite coffee machine\n            Byron Beach Club bathrobes and slippers to use during the cruise\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all suites include:\n    \n        \n            Priority check-in and boarding\n            Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n            Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times\n                later than 9:30 AM\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n            Two large bottles of water\n            Pillow-top mattress\n            Curated in-stateroom bath products\n            Bathrobes\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 6},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-encounter', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Byron Beach Extended Balcony Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Byron Beach Extended Balcony Suite\n                        A Byron Beach Extended Balcony Suite puts its proudest perk right in the name. (Feel that breeze!) Inside you'll also find a sitting area, walk-in closet and deluxe bathroom with a tub. And don't forget, your suite includes access to the Byron Beach Club and more exclusive perks!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to Byron Beach suites:\n    \n        \n            Complimentary access to Byron Beach Club\n            Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n            Exclusive breakfast at Angelo’s\n            Complimentary in-suite continental breakfast menu\n            Exclusive spa discounts on treatments during port days\n            In-suite coffee machine\n            Byron Beach Club bathrobes and slippers to use during the cruise\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all suites include:\n    \n        \n            Priority check-in and boarding\n            Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n            Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times\n                later than 9:30 AM\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n            Two large bottles of water\n            Pillow-top mattress\n            Curated in-stateroom bath products\n            Bathrobes\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 7},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-encounter', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Byron Beach Grand Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Byron Beach Grand Suite\n                        A Byron Beach Grand Suite features a large balcony and even more space than a standard suite. There's also a spacious sitting area, walk-in closet and bathroom with a shower and separate tub. And don't forget, your suite includes access to the Byron Beach Club and more exclusive perks!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to Byron Beach suites:\n    \n        \n            Complimentary access to Byron Beach Club\n            Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n            Exclusive breakfast at Angelo’s\n            Complimentary in-suite continental breakfast menu\n            Exclusive spa discounts on treatments during port days\n            In-suite coffee machine\n            Byron Beach Club bathrobes and slippers to use during the cruise\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all suites include:\n    \n        \n            Priority check-in and boarding\n            Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n            Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times\n                later than 9:30 AM\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n            Two large bottles of water\n            Pillow-top mattress\n            Curated in-stateroom bath products\n            Bathrobes\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 8},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-encounter', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Byron Beach Vista Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Byron Beach Vista Suite\n                        A Byron Beach Vista Suite offers more space for stretching out indoors, plus a large balcony for lounging with a bit of breeze. Enjoy a sitting area, plus get conveniences like a walk-in closet and a deluxe bathroom with a tub. And don't forget, your suite includes access to the Byron Beach Club and more exclusive perks!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to Byron Beach suites:\n    \n        \n            Complimentary access to Byron Beach Club\n            Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n            Exclusive breakfast at Angelo’s\n            Complimentary in-suite continental breakfast menu\n            Exclusive spa discounts on treatments during port days\n            In-suite coffee machine\n            Byron Beach Club bathrobes and slippers to use during the cruise\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all suites include:\n    \n        \n            Priority check-in and boarding\n            Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n            Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times\n                later than 9:30 AM\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n            Two large bottles of water\n            Pillow-top mattress\n            Curated in-stateroom bath products\n            Bathrobes\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 9},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-encounter', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Byron Beach Ocean Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': "Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Byron Beach Ocean Suite\n                        A Byron Beach Ocean Suite features unique décor and offers more space for stretching out indoors, plus a large balcony for lounging with a bit of breeze. Experience private, spacious relaxation… and a deluxe bathroom with a tub. And don't forget, your suite includes access to the Byron Beach Club and more exclusive perks!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to Byron Beach suites:\n    \n        \n            Complimentary access to Byron Beach Club\n            Immediate access to your suite after boarding\n            Exclusive breakfast at Angelo’s\n            Complimentary in-suite continental breakfast menu \n            Exclusive spa discounts on treatments during port days\n            In-suite coffee machine\n            Byron Beach Club bathrobes and slippers to use during the cruise\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, all suites include:\n    \n        \n            Priority check-in and boarding\n            Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n            Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times\n                later than 9:30 AM\n            Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n            Two large bottles of water\n            Pillow-top mattress\n            Curated in-stateroom bath products\n            Bathrobes\n        \n        \xa0\n    \n\n\n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control", 'image_url': None, 'order': 10},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-encounter', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Ocean Suite', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Ocean Suite\n                        An Ocean Suite offers more space for stretching out indoors, plus a large balcony for kicking back outdoors. Experience private, spacious relaxation… and a deluxe bathroom with a tub!\n                            \n    Amenities exclusive to suites:\n    \n    \n        Priority check-in and boarding\n        Priority dinner reservations at most specialty dining spots\n        Priority debarkation at homeport, and ports of call requiring a water shuttle or with arrival times later than 9:30 AM\n        Complimentary wash & fold laundry service (1 bag per cruise)\n        Two large bottles of water\n        Pillow-top mattress\n        Curated in-stateroom bath products\n        Bathrobes\n    \n    \xa0\n    \n    \n    \n    Plus, every room includes:\n    \n        Dedicated stateroom attendant\n        Soft, cozy linens\n        Plenty of closet and drawer space\n        In-room safe for valuables\n        Television\n        Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 11},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'zone', 'title': 'Grand Central', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': '<strong>Grand Central</strong> is designed to make an impression… and that\'s good because it\'s going to be the first one on your vacation! You can count on Carnival Festivale\'s atrium to set the vacay vibes for your whole cruise. Look up and you\'re honestly in for an eyeful — floor-to-ceiling windows, 14-foot LED screens, a ceiling of 1,400 color-changing lights… everything points to big fun happening in here. And even if you\'re just passing through, know that you\'ll definitely be back later. <strong>Center Stage</strong> features a rotating selection of live entertainment, while <strong>Grand View Bar</strong> serves up great drinks with plenty to feast your eyes on. In Grand Central you\'re never far from cups of comfort at <strong>JavaBlue<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> Café</strong>, great dining spots like <strong></strong>Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> and <strong>Bonsai Teppanyaki<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup></strong>, plus feel-good entertainment like <strong>Piano Bar 88<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup></strong> and <strong>The Punchliner Comedy Club<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup></strong>.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/zones/carnival-festivale-grand-central-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 1},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'zone', 'title': 'Studio 724', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'The best thing about music is that when it happens, it\'s in the air for all to hear. And on Carnival Festivale, one major source of sounds will be <strong>Studio 724</strong>, a zone spanning two decks, which brings together not only immersive audio, but lighting, animations and more. The zone weaves all the elements into a unique way to experience music that you won\'t find anywhere else. But there\'s more going on than sight and sound... there\'s flavor too. Savor a French-inspired meal at <strong>Le Bistro Musicale</strong>. And whether you\'re sipping cocktails at fan-favorite bars like <strong>Alchemy Bar</strong> to <strong>Piano Bar 88<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup></strong>, or enjoying the delicious creations at our new releases like <strong>The Spark</strong> and <strong>Mix</strong>, Studio 724 is an innovation in surround taste, too!', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/zones/carnival-festivale-studio-724-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 2},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'zone', 'title': 'The Festival', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': "Outdoor music festivals are great ways to catch a bunch of favorites, all in one fun spot. So it's only right that Carnival Festivale pays tribute to this phenomenon, bringing it to sea at <strong>The Festival</strong>! Stroll, dance and dine your way through this zone at your own pace, sampling or indulging in everything great. Some highlights include <strong>Pizza Palooza</strong> and <strong>Rhythm &amp; Rolls Deli</strong>, both of which combine well-loved flavors with creative twists inspired by food truck fare. <strong>Festival Grounds Coffee &amp; Bar</strong> does a variety of not only refreshing drinks, but vibes as well, with a distinct shift when the sun goes down. Since this flavor festival runs all day, all cruise long, you'll have plenty of time to taste as you go. There's more delicious&nbsp;headliners to be announced, too!", 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/zones/carnival-festivale-the-festival-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 3},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'zone', 'title': 'Summer Landing', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Go ahead and call <strong>Summer Landing</strong> \'the greatest chill spot at sea\'... and we\'ll be right there with you, any time of year! What\'s three letters long and goes great with chilling outdoors? BBQ, so we\'re building a <strong>Guy\'s Pig &amp; Anchor Smokehouse | Brewhouse</strong> into this zone so it always tastes like summer here with freshly-smoked faves designed by Guy Fieri and original Parched Pig<sup style="font-size:70%;">®</sup> beers brewed just feet away. If you\'re wondering where the pool and whirlpool are, we\'re so alike, you and us... and that\'s why we\'re sure you\'re gonna love <strong>The Watering Hole</strong>, a poolside bar we\'re building for aficionados of backyard-style relaxation. And for military folks — or folks who just want to raise a glass to them — please report to <strong>Heroes Tribute<sup style="font-size:70%;">™</sup> Lounge</strong> for great service. We know you guys like soft serve too, so we\'re throwing in a <strong>Swirls</strong><sup style="font-size:70%;">™</sup> location — one of two! And why wouldn\'t we? At Summer Landing, fun this cool is literally always in season.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/zones/carnival-festivale-summer-landing-slide.jpg', 'order': 4},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'zone', 'title': 'Lido', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'If you’ve cruised with us before, you know <strong>Lido</strong>... but aboard Carnival Festivale this poolside zone features even more delicious and fun experiences among the familiar flavors. Evolving the classic poolside rum-bar is <strong>RedFrog<sup style="font-size:70%">®</sup> Tiki Bar</strong>, which will be serving up the good stuff across two decks’ worth of South Pacific atmosphere. Also always fresh is <strong>Street Eats</strong>, bringing together highlights from the world’s fast-good cuisine like kebab, bao buns and seriously upgraded fries. Shaq’s <strong>Big Chicken<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">™</sup></strong> restaurant is here, and fan-fave spots like <strong>Guy’s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">™</sup></strong>, the New England-inspired <strong>Seafood Shack<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">™</sup></strong>, and <strong>BlueIguana Cantina<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">™</sup></strong> taco spot aren’t done with your taste buds yet. And for folks hoping we haven’t forgotten: yes, Lido is absolutely home to one of two <strong>Swirls<sup style="font-size:70%; line-height:12px;">™</sup></strong> locations, the free soft-serve spot!', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/zones/carnival-festivale-lido-slide.jpg', 'order': 5},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'zone', 'title': 'SUNSATION POINT', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': "Sea days — or any days — are the perfect days to spend at <strong>Sunsation Point</strong>. This zone is a place for families that spans not only multiple decks, but multiple vibes. Things start with <strong>Carnival WaterWorks Ultra</strong>, a high-energy waterpark that's our biggest one ever. But all that water is just the beginning of the Sunsation story. <strong>Fairway 66 Mini Golf</strong> lets you drive down the greens, avoiding fun obstacles inspired by the iconic roadway, plus you'll find a <strong>ropes course</strong>, <strong>adventure trail</strong>, <strong>sports court</strong> and more. There are spots for kicking back, including lounge chairs and a <strong>scenic overlook</strong> with sunset views, <strong>casual games</strong> and more. The <strong>Vault Retrocade</strong>, and tasty spots like <strong>Swirls</strong>, <strong>Sunsation Sips</strong> and <strong>Big Chicken</strong>, round out the experience, making this just the place for fun all day… and night, when unique evening entertainment and special events are just getting things going.", 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/zones/carnival-festivale-sunsation-point-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 6},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'CARNIVAL WATERWORKS ULTRA', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': "Sunsation Point's splashing, glistening jewel of fun under the sun is Carnival WaterWorks Ultra. Yes to brag, but this is the most family-friendly waterpark at sea, and Carnival's biggest yet! Designed to deliver the H, the 2 and the O to all guests, this one is packing <strong>six thrilling waterslides</strong>, plus a <strong>splash pad designed just for babies</strong>... with another pad for everyone. If you love waterslides, here's what you need to know: we're talking a pair of <strong>family raft rides (Turning Tides </strong> and <strong>SunSoaker)</strong>, two sets of <strong>racing slides (Racing Currents</strong> and <strong>Mini Racers)</strong>, one <strong>twisty kids' slide (Mini Twister)</strong>, and one <strong>splashtacular spiral slide</strong> for everyone. What's the speed limit here? That's between you and physics!", 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-waterworks-ultra-slide-desktop.jpg', 'order': 7},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'THE SPARK', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'Where will you be when inspiration strikes? Probably at The Spark, the kind of bar where musicians and songwriters gather to get their own inspiration going. Even the menu gets in on the act, reminding us of some of the most iconic titles of all time, right there in the drink names. Order based on your favorite flavors —&nbsp;or sounds —&nbsp;and enjoy sips that pair perfectly with nightly live performances in this cozy, creative setting.\n', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-the-spark-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 8},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'ACTIVE SPORTS AND FUN', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': "When you're ready to take a break from relaxing, get down to&nbsp;some action at the sports court. This is the place to bring your A-game — whether that's a pickup round of <strong>basketball</strong> or <strong>pickleball</strong>, it's always set against some stunning ocean views. The <strong>ropes course</strong> has views that are perhaps even better, as you'll be suspended high above the deck while challenging one of two courses — one that actually takes you safely over the deck's edge! Whether you're warming up for action, or cooling down afterwards, you can enjoy family-friendly games like <strong>foosball</strong> or <strong>mini-golf</strong>. <strong>Sidelines</strong> is the shaded courtside seats that are a great place to watch the action or just take a break.", 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-active-sports-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 9},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'MIX', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'Whether you want to sip something from the pros, or noodle on a cocktail idea you\'ve been meaning to work out, Mix is the spot to sip creatively. The signature cocktails have names like "Synth" and "Hi-Fi," and listen up —&nbsp;they taste as great as they sound. And if you\'re ready to get creative, the bar lets you play producer and choose the flavor "tracks" that go into your own creation.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-mix-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 10},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'FESTIVALE CASINO', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': "Feeling lucky? Visit Festivale Casino — the largest casino in Carnival’s fleet. With the latest slots and table games, plus dedicated smoking and non-smoking areas, it’s designed for every kind of player. And for the first time ever, you can go for a $1 Million Dollar Slot Progressive Jackpot and experience fleetwide progressive jackpots on poker and blackjack. Whether you're chasing big wins or just enjoying the excitement, Festivale Casino is your ultimate gaming destination.&nbsp;", 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-casino-slide-desktop.jpg', 'order': 11},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'ALCHEMY BAR', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'Alchemy Bar is Carnival Festivale\'s unique vintage-themed cocktail "pharmacy," and we\'ve flipped through dusty old texts to uncover enticing combinations: select spirits, fresh juices, infused syrups, spices… and other tantalizing secrets performed before your very eyes by the true mix-masters. Choose a remedy from the menu, or let us prescribe&nbsp;a custom elixir just for you, with or without alcohol, and enjoy it in an expanded lounge setting complete with a stage for live music performances.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-alchemy-bar-slide-hero-desktop.jpg', 'order': 12},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'CENTER STAGE & PLAYLIST PRODUCTIONS', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'They’re not plays, they’re not exactly concerts… these shows are something else entirely. Every performance is built on amazing songs you know and love, presented like you’ve never seen before. Your favorites become full-blown musical productions featuring singers and dancers bringing down the house, filling the stage with song, dance... and superstar attitude.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-playlist-productions-slide.jpg', 'order': 13},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'SERENITY ADULT-ONLY RETREAT', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'Somebody at Carnival knows just what you need, and it\'s pretty much exactly the Serenity Adult-Only Retreat<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup>. Look, you\'ll still be on the same ship as the kids, the hoopla, and all the Carnival-style excitement... but you could easily forget, because when you\'re at Serenity you could not be further from it all. The world you\'ll find yourself in is one of complete peace, sea breezes and, of course, a nearby bar. It\'s the place to get done the kind of stuff you just can\'t seem to do anywhere else — reconnect with your partner, finish that book, or do absolutely, blissfully, nothing at all.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-serenity.jpg', 'order': 14},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'Family Feud Live', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'The show has been delighting viewers at home for generations, but Carnival ships are the only place you can buzz-in at sea. We\'ll be hosting games on an authentic Family Feud<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> set — right down to the iconic Face-Off podium, plus all the excitement of Fast Money. Family Feud Live<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> will be emceed by none other than your cruise director, so if you\'re game, sign up your team of five for an audition… and make sure they bring that Family Feud spirit. And, of course, everybody\'s welcome to grab a seat in the audience to catch all the hilarious action!', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-family-feud-live-desktop-2.jpg', 'order': 15},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'CLOUD 9 SPA', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'True or false: cruises are a time for relaxation. Our answer: whether you\'re all action all the time, or chill to the core, everybody needs a chance to take it easy! And nobody will find an easier spot than Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup> aboard Carnival Festivale. This is an oasis built from the ground up for relaxation, from a full complement of traditional spa services like massages, facials, body wraps to the carefully-designed climates of Cloud 9\'s thermal suites... rooms swirling with moist or dry air, each heated very precisely. It turns out it\'s true: anyone can find a reason to say \'ahhh\' at Carnival Festivale\'s Cloud 9 Spa.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-cloud-9-spa.jpg', 'order': 16},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'THE PUNCHLINER COMEDY CLUB', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'Carnival Festivale has its own Punchliner Comedy Club in the Grand Central zone, and up on stage you’ll find some real pros who know how to wedge a little laughter into anyone’s evening. You can count on these comedians to not hold back either. Since some of them get up and say exactly what’s on their mind, we also schedule family-friendly performances… so the only red faces in the audience are from laughing a little too hard.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/onboard-activities/carnival-festivale-punchliner-comedy-club.jpg', 'order': 17},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': '…AND THAT WAS JUST WARM-UP!', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': '', 'image_url': None, 'order': 18},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': "Emeril's Coastal Seafood", 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'Welcome to Emeril’s Coastal Seafood, where flavors from the Gulf to New England are infused with his signature Creole flair. Discover a vibrant take on coastal cuisine blending rich heritage, fresh ingredients and inventive touches in every dish. Settle into a dining experience that captures seaside charm with effortless sophistication — refined, yet relaxed. From fresh oysters and Gulf shrimp to whole roasted fish and chef-driven specialties, the menu celebrates the best of land and sea. Each plate is based on traditional recipes, sprinkled with energy, and finished with that signature kick. Whether you’re a seafood lover or simply craving something soulful, you’re invited to unwind, indulge, and savor the coastal journey.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/emerils-coastal-seafood-slide.jpg', 'order': 19},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Fetaccine', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'Inspired by the vibrant spirit of the Mediterranean, Fetaccine is where Greek seaside flavors meet rich Italian culinary tradition. With its breezy, seaside vibe and welcoming hospitality, Fetaccine turns every meal into a laid-back culinary escape. Start with sizzling shrimp saganaki, then dive into favorites like chicken parmesan or perfectly prepared Greek lamb chops. Have room for dessert? The cannolis are a must! Each dish celebrates time-honored recipes while adding just the right touch of something fresh and new. So join us where great food, good company and a love of Mediterranean culture come together in every flavorful bite. <strong>Tip:</strong> Great news! Your first meal at Fetaccine is on the house… and additional visits are just $8.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/fetaccine-slide.jpg', 'order': 20},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Uku Lei Lei', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'Step into a vibrant island escape where the spirit of Hawaii meets bold Asian flavor. At Uku Lei Lei, you’re invited to indulge in a tropical-inspired menu — all in a colorful setting designed to capture the lush beauty and warmth of the Hawaiian Islands. From your first bite, the experience is all about discovery. Savor delicious dishes like Mongolian beef short rib, dive into fresh poke bowls, or treat yourself to tropical-infused desserts that deliver a sweet finish. Every dish blends familiar favorites with unexpected twists, bringing together the best of the Pacific’s most irresistible flavors. With its relaxed, island vibe, vibrant textures and attentive service, Uku Lei Lei offers a fun, feel-good dining escape where tradition meets innovation — and every visit feels like a celebration. <strong>Tip:</strong> Great news! Your first meal at Uku Lei Lei is on the house… and additional visits are just $8.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/uku-lei-lei-slide.jpg', 'order': 21},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Le Bistro Musicale', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': "At Le Bistro Musicale, you'll surround yourself with the timeless charm of a Parisian café and savor a menu that reads like a love letter to classic French cuisine. From crisp steak frites and indulgent chicken cordon bleu to rich French onion soup and freshly shucked oysters, each dish is crafted with care and a touch of artistry. It’s familiar comfort food, elevated just enough to feel special while staying warm and welcoming. Whether you’re stopping in for a leisurely breakfast, a casual bite or a romantic dinner, Le Bistro Musicale fits any mood with ease. And with nearby live music, there’s always that extra touch of French flair in the air.", 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/le-bistro-musicale-slide.jpg', 'order': 22},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Bonsai Teppanyaki', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'It’s a meal, a performance, and it’s definitely unforgettable. The Bonsai Teppanyaki<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup> experience is set to delight guests aboard Carnival Festivale. Take a little time out of vacation to sit down to a selection of tempting appetizers, before your chef prepares the main course featuring selections of meats, tofu, fish, shrimp or lobster… right at your table. In the teppanyaki tradition — and Carnival’s tradition of fun — expect an interactive, satisfying meal full of surprise and delicious delight. ', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/carnival-festivale-bonsai-teppanyaki-slide.jpg', 'order': 23},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': "Guy's Pig & Anchor Smokehouse | Brewhouse", 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'With choices like brisket, sausage, baby back ribs and dry-rubbed chicken, our pros do the smoking right there over hickory wood before serving them up at your table. Those aromas mean you’re in Guy Fieri’s house — Carnival Festivale has Guy’s Pig &amp; Anchor Smokehouse | Brewhouse. Now about the brews: this house of BBQ tradition doesn’t just satisfy your hunger — you’ll also enjoy our exclusive line of Parched Pig<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup> craft brews. There’s a smoked porter, a farmhouse ale, a hoppy IPA and a toasted amber, all brewed just feet from your table. <strong>Tip:</strong> Come by and check out the free menu at lunchtime, plus live music and lively atmosphere all day.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/JB/carnival-jubilee/dining/carnival-jubilee-pig-anchor-slide-2.jpg', 'order': 24},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Bonsai Sushi', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'So maybe you’ve had sushi before, but have you tried it at Bonsai Sushi<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup>? This is Carnival’s onboard seafood-and-soy-sauce spot, and we think you’ll enjoy our latest location, aboard Carnival Festivale. Dine indoors or out amidst carefully-pruned bonsai trees, while enjoying a delectable menu with sit-down service. Rounding out the meal: soups, sides, sakes and desserts. So the next time you’re taking a stroll down the onboard promenade, stop at Bonsai Sushi for a roll, a box or maybe order a whole sushi ship — seaborne satisfaction for two.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/carnival-festivale-bonsai-sushi-slide.jpg', 'order': 25},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': "Guy's Burger Joint", 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'We call Carnival Festivale\'s onboard burger spot Guy’s Burger Joint<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup>. We teamed up with Guy Fieri to design not just the burgers and fries, but to help bring in the kind of rustic atmosphere you’d find at a roadside burger shack somewhere off a coastal highway. All signs point to ambiance — and serious flavor — so try a burger dressed up the way Guy likes it, or take it off-roading… to the nearby topping bar, where you can make it your own.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/carnival-festivale-guys-burger-joint-slide.jpg', 'order': 26},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Fahrenheit 555 Steakhouse', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'Haute cuisine meets atmosphere at Fahrenheit 555<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup>, a dining experience that stands toe-to-toe with some of the best steakhouses on land. Except this one’s at sea — aboard Carnival Festivale. Ours features your choice of steak cuts, lobster, lamb and more… and inside, there’s even a full bar that pours great pairings. These are the building blocks of an amazing experience — delectable elements that combine with great service to offer an evening to remember.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/carnival-festivale-fahrenheit-555-steakhouse-slide.jpg', 'order': 27},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Big Chicken', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'When Shaq says build a chicken joint on board, you start warming up immediately. The big guy brings his poultry know-how, and good taste, to the seas with Big Chicken<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup> on Carnival Festivale. Just like Shaq’s a multitalented entertainer, his restaurant is no one-trick chick. Step up to the counter for lunch or dinner and walk away with your choice of chicken sandwiches, crispy chicken strips or juicy fried chicken baskets... plus side dishes like potato salad and jalapeño slaw. You early-morning buzzer-beaters are invited to enjoy a breakfast of classics like chicken biscuits, a three-cheese omelet or our biscuit/egg combo featuring bacon or sausage. Snoozers are invited, too — breakfast is served until 3!', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/carnival-festivale-big-chicken-slide.jpg', 'order': 28},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Seafood Shack', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': 'A good seafood dish… mmm, quite the catch. However you like yours — roll, bowl or platter — Seafood Shack<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup> is Carnival Festivale\'s place for you to cast your net. Imagine a seaside spot in New England, where the locals gather for great meals served with a bit of a breeze and a lot of a view. (That said, nowhere on land will you get 360-degree ocean views like ours!) Look to Seafood Shack for rustic favorites like Crab Cake Sliders, Lobster BLT, Fried Buffalo Shrimp, Snow Crab and more. Steer a course for Carnival Festivale… that’s where you’ll find this little shack by the sea, wherever in the world you happen to be!', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/dining/carnival-festivale-seafood-shack-1.jpg', 'order': 29},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Street Eats', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': 'Some of the world’s favorite flavors aren’t found in restaurants, but on the street in trucks, stalls and carts where flavor, convenience... and quality matter. That’s right, when you’re just feet from the chef, you know they’re cooking to impress! Street Eats is Carnival’s tribute to this food phenomenon, with three open-air stations. The first, Steam Dream, specializes in the steamiest stuff this side of the spa, featuring favorites like bao buns and pot stickers. Then there’s Mad Sizzle, which puts the “skill” in skillet with the likes of kebab and satay. And we’re definitely not about to forget Time Fries, which serves up every cruiser’s dream: fries loaded up with culinary creations from our chefs, like cheesesteak fries! On Carnival Festivale you may be far from the street, but flavor’s always right around the corner.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/MD/mardi-gras/dining/mardi-gras-street-eats-slide-desktop-2.jpg', 'order': 30},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': '…AND THOSE WERE JUST OUR GREATEST HITS!', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': '', 'image_url': None, 'order': 31},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'STATEROOM DESIGN', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Design is more than just the way things look — it\'s as much about how they work. And staterooms aboard Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> are packed with innovative changes to both. It\'s the way the ring-lit vanity mirror lights you evenly and shadow-free as you get ready. How the ottoman cushion flips over to serve as an extra table. And even those reading lights, recessed into the wall so you can read in bed without waking anyone! These details are really more than just details. Better comfort, lighting and storage all spring from a deep understanding we\'ve developed around how people actually use their staterooms… and how small changes to the room add up to make the experience that much better. (Enough USB charging ports for everybody’s stuff? Oh yes!) Thoughtful, guest-centric design is how we do it… and all this in-room convenience comes paired with a fresh new look.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-staterooms-design.jpg', 'order': 32},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Havana Staterooms & Suites', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Consider your Havana stateroom or suite your own island resort aboard Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup>. Most important is the exclusive location: near the Havana Bar &amp; Pool. This relaxation pool is your members-only spot, and the bar\'s a fun-for-all hotspot when the sun goes down. Indoors, all Havana staterooms feature a unique décor, but step up to a Havana Cabana for an extra-large outdoor chill space. Step into a Havana Cabana suite for even more space, plus a luxurious rain shower. <em>(All Havana stateroom guests must be 12 or older.)</em>', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-staterooms-havana.jpg', 'order': 33},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Cloud 9 Spa Staterooms & Suites', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Cloud 9 Spa<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup> staterooms on Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> feature exclusive décor and in-room amenities to help soothe you after a long day’s fun — spa bathrobes and slippers, plus toiletries by Elemis. Book one of these staterooms and enjoy priority spa reservations, unlimited access to the thermal suites, free fitness classes, exclusive discounts and more! And you can have comfort and value — Carnival Festivale\'s got a full range of Cloud 9 staterooms in all sizes, from cozy Interiors to stretch-out Suites.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-stateroom-suites-cloud-9-spa-slide.jpg', 'order': 34},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior Staterooms', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Here’s the most affordable way to experience Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup>, without cutting even a single corner in the comfort department. With an Interior stateroom you’ll get a full private bathroom, your choice of bed size and layout — covered in linens you can feel at home in — all of which make this truly a great spot for curling up after a long day’s fun.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-staterooms-interior.jpg', 'order': 35},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Ocean View Staterooms', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'These comfy rooms with a view let you take in the scenery as you sail toward your beautiful destinations. And how about those views? Nowhere on land will you find anything like ‘em. But the views aren’t all that matters here — Ocean View staterooms on Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> are a little bit bigger than Interior rooms and most feature a supremely loungeable couch for those times when neither lying nor standing will do.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-staterooms-ocean-view.jpg', 'order': 36},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Balcony Staterooms', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Balcony staterooms are proof that while it’s great to be cruisey… on vacation, breeziness is a virtue too. And any time you’re in your well-appointed Balcony stateroom aboard Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup>, you’re just steps away from the outdoors by way of your private open-air oasis. Designed for kicking back al fresco, you’re in for some amazing ocean views… views so stunning you’ll just have to feel ‘em to believe ‘em.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-staterooms-balcony.jpg', 'order': 37},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Suites', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Get all the comforts of home, and even a few extras. Since your huge Suite on Carnival Festivale<sup style="font-size:70%">™</sup> affords you VIP status, you\'re in the priority line when getting on and off the ship… plus Suites come with exclusive perks! (Carnival Excel Suites pack even more, like concierge service and access to Loft 19™.) A Suite is the ultimate way to enjoy the ship, and the extra comfort definitely goes a long way, with more room to put your feet up or stretch out on the extra-large balcony.', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-staterooms-suite-slide.jpg', 'order': 38},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-festivale', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'LOFT 19', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': 'Loft 19<sup style="font-size: 70%;">™</sup> was designed to afford you a unique opportunity for relaxation and indulgence. This retreat-style space invites you to soak up the sun all day from the comfort of a lounge chair or infinity whirlpool. This pairs so perfectly with Carnival Excel suites that staying in one actually gets you Loft 19 access! Drink service is always close at hand, plus you can even opt for a little private time — renting a cabana gets you more than just a place in the shade, but extras like fresh fruit, chilled towels, lunch delivery and concierge service. (Cabana rentals are open to everyone, though guests in Carnival Excel-level suites enjoy priority reservations.)', 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/Ships/FT/carnival-festivale/staterooms/carnival-festivale-loft-19-slide.jpg', 'order': 39},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-firenze', 'kind': 'activity', 'title': 'WaterWorks', 'cost': 'included', 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/explore/onboard/outdoor/waterworks-tile.jpg', 'href': '/onboard/waterworks', 'order': 0},
