    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-firenze', 'kind': 'dining', 'title': 'Seafood Shack', 'cost': 'additional', 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': '/-/media/Images/explore/dining/seafood-shack-tile.jpg', 'href': '/cruise-food/seafood-shack', 'order': 8},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-firenze', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Terrazza Interior', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\nNext items in the Carousel\n1\n2\nTERRAZZA INTERIOR\n\nA cozy, classic stateroom decked out with Italian flair… plus amenities like exclusive access to a private deck featuring all-day lounging with great drinks, entertainment, whirlpools and more.\xa0(All Terrazza stateroom guests must be 12 or older.)\n\nAmenities exclusive to Terrazza staterooms:\n\nAccess to Terrazza Moda – a private deck featuring all-day lounging with great drinks, entertainment, whirlpools and more\nMorning access to Moda Lounge for a daily select breakfast menu\nSailaway event at Terrazza Moda, featuring live music\nComfy Terrazza-branded robes and towels for your use\n\n\n\nPlus, every room includes:\n\nDedicated stateroom attendant\nSoft, cozy linens\nPlenty of closet and drawer space\nIn-room safe for valuables\nTelevision\nStateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 0},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-firenze', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior with Picture Window (Walkway View)', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Interior with Picture Window (Walkway View)\n                        Your picture window gives you a view beyond your stateroom, to the observation deck outside, including a great sky view. (Note: view will be partially obstructed.)\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    Soft, cozy linens\n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 1},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-firenze', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior with Portholes', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Interior with Portholes\n                        A pair of round windows in your room give you the classic seafarer’s view times two, a view of the ocean without breaking the budget.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    Soft, cozy linens\n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 2},
    {'ship_slug': 'carnival-firenze', 'kind': 'stateroom', 'title': 'Interior', 'cost': None, 'desc_html': None, 'text': 'Previous items in the Carousel\n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        \n                                            \n                                        Next items in the Carousel12\n\n\n                        Interior\n                        This is an affordable way to cruise without leaving out the comfort or convenience! Great for curling up after a long day of fun.\n                            \n  Every room includes:\n  \n    Dedicated stateroom attendant\n    Soft, cozy linens\n    Plenty of closet and drawer space\n    In-room safe for valuables\n    Television\n    Stateroom climate control', 'image_url': None, 'order': 3},
